              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eri omvi e’yo kini, Ekile Yehova Mungu minirini ovule indirile, ma ovuni enya olemi be gaa aluni ku, kiri anyafura were driega alua afazu aliari pi odu were otekua aliari be; mi ne, ma eja iri ’diyi omvu, ’dini ma mvi ani nyaka nderi a’di ma dri mva be, ama di nya ra, ama dra ndo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
